#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:5
#: 6046c6fdbf114908b7709c114b0879f0 a918b98440874bb195bafbacae3b6478
#: b6db747e35cd4af3a021d555a248057b c3ff0094447b44c1b5f9dd404858f09d
#: c4ad27bcdaef43d69cd91be347693d89 ccfac9d4853e49e7aa55ed70d2cfec0f
#: f348cc40286d4870b756bd6c23cc5bc3 f5536b283c6e43488a53a692b50e5e5e
msgid "MAVLink2 Signing"
msgstr "MAVLink2 签名"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:7
#: 059b05db41bf401ab5f672f986886ea7 21767cb6201f4cacbac6eee0aabd576f
#: 88d7bad8a79847fd944b51f87f85bb62 89e70c482c244ec08399615c83eeaac0
#: 9ceb7ce40b6340e9a5790709c9eb773d a660e958afd14ee49dfd312d0e3002f3
#: c0d9ff953c154faca818b3e52b682a7b f81d0a0ca091419b999f48567a155663
msgid ""
"ArduPilot and Mission Planner have the ability to add security to over-the-"
"air MAVLink transmissions by adding packet signing using an encrypted key. "
"This does NOT encrypt the data, just merely controls if the autopilot will "
"respond to MAVLink commands or not."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 和 Mission Planner 支持通过使用加密密钥进行数据包签名，为无线 MAVLink "
"传输添加安全性。此功能不加密数据，仅控制飞控是否响应 MAVLink 命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:9
#: 8760a4e254324fa2bce963bf3f163b3e 8a37e54cb95a43c6a44592b200473201
#: 8c2afb3205a448bb9ce3f99494c98418 9bd87082035044fab14fcd6125fa7f97
#: a80b0e77ab7242628eb658cc0de40a2b b67c69e2b4214aa0b2c1f09f9a1a01ff
#: b8bc9efef15641b39281b0669f30b04c bd9192ffeca54e529a31a326d69cb7af
msgid ""
"When active in the autopilot, any non-USB serial port can be configured only"
" to respond to MAVLink command requests from Mission Planner if they contain"
" the passkey. This prevents other Ground Control Stations (GCS) that do not "
"know the passkey from reading or writing parameters and sending commands. "
"Something that is possible otherwise."
msgstr ""
"在飞控上启用后，任何非 USB 串口都可配置为仅响应包含通行密钥的 Mission Planner MAVLink "
"命令请求。这可以防止不知道通行密钥的其他地面控制站（GCS）读取或写入参数及发送命令——否则这些操作默认是被允许的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:11
#: 23417e936c534b0ebaf22af5169333b9 24ba17066e574ee7b5b8dd1201f39c3e
#: 4124c3449bc74457b18f6b567ca02aa4 52c97751015f47148f0214b4343d3881
#: 54a2bf75db9641ccbb08c534c8a1c69f 96510152da8a4412b00df885b3a2543c
#: b0aa1501f9f44a65ac8f5d8367f29ec3 d58d6bc9f91e42e99d0b09b152c2d85f
msgid "Telemetry downlink data is unaffected."
msgstr "数传下行数据不受影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:13
#: 2fa3d862ec6d4249a84065657e602d0d 4d88bad13a454cd286b2226207a843d3
#: 4fe4d3b20d984b4797c67d589b7c5449 5ce3df0963294bda9a125ec1c63fafdb
#: 6eb7d6e4bb3e40719a46805bbf764029 77841c8291a943279024ef1c27da6785
#: a994e71488fe4cc8a4b6f3efeaf6adac d5808a524f4e466a87f1540059b6ad19
msgid ""
"USB connections are unaffected, allowing full connection to an autopilot "
"using an unknown passkey and allowing the user to erase (disable signing) or"
" change the passkey it uses."
msgstr "USB 连接不受影响，允许完整连接到使用未知通行密钥的飞控，并允许用户擦除（禁用签名）或更改使用的通行密钥。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:16
#: 2d6a889c46de457f9f65662543d578c5 7a0bd4fe6d19440195594ab35fe3e4ff
#: 94633bfb0b26487bb367386d7531e8be bda7b852e7bf4ce1b69642212810ba68
#: e6a8bb4376fc4fc583290644579f83fb ebee7a96252e4c63a21bce6675f8f6ac
#: f7357482771c482b8d8b3a1240368dee fc0d62de575b45ac8e10fa724fcfeeac
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:18
#: 0553f3e62fcb49718329429012fd2c6a 0d5abd31d7624dd98a050351ea63ceef
#: 1c1fa28e99664647872c574d324bb98d 266783e0b3624f25af9e875b2ddc938e
#: b7bc636103bf48668944c396ae0efeb3 c265a9b8abe04ca3b074578cc877be36
#: e16587a6650e476c88da97619e64a2f5 f665022155da4bd684bcab057896dea4
msgid ""
"Make sure the telemetry port protocol is set to option = 2 (MAVLink2). "
"Communication with any serial port using MAVLink 1 is not protected."
msgstr "确保数传端口协议已设置为选项 = 2（MAVLink2）。通过 MAVLink 1 与任何串口的通信不受保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:20
#: 011f81e1808748fe8df5433fc49d187e 6c1df0ed9dc7426ea76aa2b9cb7dc0b2
#: 6d059e0d9739419f9b15ef4d18661d27 7bd58df16ac1483bb034f2a0ea1aecc6
#: 8bdb1d781ae14d6485a5d8a21fd0d1d7 92561bc4f509422e83173e2d90574909
#: d5b0d41e2ee4465e815d331e4227060e ed5d091bb10148d3b4c96c4735a70a10
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner, connect the autopilot, use the SETUP menu  and the "
"Advanced submenu, and press \"Mavlink Signing\""
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 中，连接飞控，使用「SETUP」菜单下的「Advanced」子菜单，然后点击「Mavlink Signing」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:25
#: 1dad310843454d7aae0affa708d467ae 24abfd1664834d1ca7706ae38a984255
#: 28fee09d9d1447c684ebe9e8ac7e892b 3676f3a9a8ec4bd594dc72190fada541
#: 3a0978e9b4e64f9c977375d35d41fbc0 440632744f8a41328eb8828b29f30b4a
#: a5c9b5f0e5634d64831ab5101aee7fb1 ebc86002b88b410e9641ac50f6abc382
msgid ""
"The dialog will show a list of all the passkeys already setup for Mission "
"Planner."
msgstr "对话框将显示 Mission Planner 已设置的所有通行密钥列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:27
#: 3106ef72c7634267b5837cc0e0c46e77 43aa2894749a470893e23c5412668754
#: 49d6f887aed4497ea7a028cdc94f55e6 4df986298e414bcab6b2e0426fe64409
#: 5c82a58a48cd480cb1fbc8b1011362de 83e7f5d4b53e4ab7a26408199ec2243f
#: bb6a6a76b79e474e9eca0bf9fa81e47b f56474a9e48e4d76a6fb254358b2817e
msgid ""
"This dialog can be used to create new keys using the ``ADD`` button.A key "
"may be removed from the list by selecting and pressing delete on the PC and "
"then the ``SAVE`` button5350. You can also do this while unconnected."
msgstr ""
"此对话框可使用 ``ADD`` 按钮创建新密钥。选中某个密钥后按 PC 上的 Delete 键，再点击 ``SAVE`` "
"按钮可将其从列表中删除。也可以在未连接时进行此操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:29
#: 1da3fa27dd4d4302b7b4851d29e0c9f4 4eb4c13d1c1b4415a29e5c2cc81e8fe5
#: 58d1b7605cb64a128beda9d01447db96 5bbecda76abf49d880033d0572638fa4
#: 6073d3b381294586a30d4b3fa0f587c0 7d42f04970d048c7b799d575999db3b3
#: b3f4abd5fb6949f78f31634c296538c0 b91d3d65fc9a4c6ca7289de783c28040
msgid ""
"To setup the autopilot to use a key from the list, press the ``USE`` button "
"on a key while connected."
msgstr "在连接状态下，按某个密钥的 ``USE`` 按钮可将飞控设置为使用该密钥。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:31
#: 36ea8a55955541698138cb9fdb24efe8 3a2a949263864871b9835ce26c4a0ca6
#: 6cd055bea7994fd79b5fbb062a980320 abcb6d3d36fa426aadd0c8114f8c4c8e
#: bc3d4a6883564b66a7400c6ce784882f d83340c6ccf04f36b51f503490ed7feb
#: e590e4e29c254a4683585a6f09f0e44c f57e8aedc96e4fa4900b959ffcac79e1
msgid ""
"You can check if the link is now signing by clicking \"Stats...\" under the "
"comm port drop down box used for selecting which port to connect."
msgstr "可通过点击用于选择连接端口的下拉框下方的「Stats...」来检查链路是否正在使用签名。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:33
#: 56a43c76450b4cd1930c7b27b2f34e1b 5c74af4c0c6f4d989e1234b109938920
#: aa35dbdc1f8e4f9ebbac7278ceb7ca02 c01c76f9cbc74e2ab507c15cffce1b1f
#: c9f4c7f2812d4b65977fd4890a632ca8 d1b7cac9fb8746d9bf9b0fcba87ce7db
#: f2f818d5ff0a4c3f882c8abac82b04a0 fc8b73e71e134a17a772f8607f5d6992
msgid ""
"To remove and disable signing for a connected autopilot, press the ``Disable"
" Signing`` button."
msgstr "要移除并禁用已连接飞控的签名，请按 ``Disable Signing`` 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:36
#: 06d31dc15a164d67901052d5bd5f1b13 136106beb98a4c8e8dd2219edcafcf05
#: 1aaa4689535d46d2b3fa73be96a3e430 74abf0f5e6514c8887e5b71228791074
#: 9dd1adb9833e4db580827ae27b6c1ac3 b66691038e9f43a6ab46fe5dcf3223b1
#: c2d0ca4624684a37af43f068f84f1847 ef7d65e03af4482f8329e73468192b71
msgid "Use"
msgstr "使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:38
#: 2ff76c0dc91840219087160cb9f4c649 411801009b414984b00425333b7a42a2
#: 62f74bbbefd1477b9475263c91b705d8 a6c7e54c7fd740b3a8072ad2f65f6c0f
#: a90c35e118984117a02b9a924e7d44f0 b23c056632fb42319430d79e8af646cd
#: c3e6149f54bb41deb424cf6a5da0c083 cad9378bc64f4d0fa4491e3ae9507e68
msgid ""
"Once the autopilot is using signing, USB connections are unaffected, but any"
" link via a SERIAL port using MAVLink2 protocol will only respond to MAVLink"
" commands if they are signed with the key the autopilot is using. But links "
"will still receive telemetry updates even if they are not using signing with"
" the active key."
msgstr ""
"飞控启用签名后，USB 连接不受影响，但通过使用 MAVLink2 协议的 SERIAL 端口连接的链路，只有在命令使用飞控正在使用的密钥签名时才会响应"
" MAVLink 命令。未使用当前密钥签名的链路仍会收到数传更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MAVLink2-signing.rst:40
#: 14ff95afbb4f4b5fa1f817716ea0f702 3d38868629af43df9a5ef177b773ad6e
#: 4f81a551be4f4289a33e3b08b8676b2f 5b81de7e415c471085e2e6470ea42b58
#: 9778b0be254c4c51b2fbaf78bb4c26be a3008eb5a977483581420a3fa01f38a2
#: a6388a970e6c401c82698ebcac0db40c bf462e5b694c46d193fe73c8ae8e7c1b
msgid ""
"When you connect Mission Planner over a link that is signing, it will see if"
" it has the correct key stored in its keys table that you would have setup "
"previously. If it does, the connection will use that key and commands will "
"be acted upon by the autopilot, including parameter download at connection. "
"If you connect, but parameter download does not occur, then the key was not "
"present. Add the key, and re-connect."
msgstr ""
"通过签名链路连接 Mission Planner "
"时，它会检查自己的密钥表中是否有之前设置的正确密钥。若有，连接将使用该密钥，飞控将执行相应命令（包括连接时的参数下载）。若连接后参数未下载，说明密钥不存在。添加密钥后重新连接即可。"
